{"id":"fecd8e75f6904d75","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-fpf.md","title":"无固定点的索引函数","display":"df-fpf — 无固定点的索引函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-fpf","aliases":["20-df-fpf"],"display":"df-fpf — 无固定点的索引函数","chapter":"5","section":"5.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.4.2","source_pdf_pages":[153],"source_printed_pages":[118],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-fpf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-fpf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fpf — 无固定点的索引函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.4.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>118</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fpf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n[W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fpf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n[W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里固定点按 c.e. 集合外延相等定义，不是要求数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(e)\\ne e\">\\(f(e)\\ne e\\)</span>；后者所有 oracle 都能做到且与 Arslanov 判据无关。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.4.2；印刷页 118；PDF 第 153 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fpf}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n[W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e].","display":true},{"tex":"f(e)\\ne e","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d1387be254aae2b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]。"},{"id":"84e66db8dad1fed1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-fpf]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}